LibDTSX (DTSX.framework)
C API and Apple packaging of a DTS:X decoder.

This product includes software from the harletty-bridge project
(https://github.com/harletty/harletty-bridge): the `dca` Rust crate
(DTS/DTS-HD/DTS:X decoder), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Copyright harletty and the harletty-bridge contributors.

The Apple framework packaging is identified as com.aetherengine.DTSX.
Its license is in LICENSE.dtsx (Apache License, Version 2.0).

